    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔοπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁράω, ὄψομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open to view</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐν εὐόπτῳ οἰκέουσιν αἱ νοῦσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>de Arte</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; <i>conspicuous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ep.Je.</u>
				60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				4.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attractive, good-looking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				21p.116H.
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				276.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(2).59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπτάω</span>) <i>well-cooked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				23.3
			</span></i>.</div>
